{
  "job_B14.45_20251003_114317": {
    "text": "Be gesceadwisan gerefan.\nSe scadwis gerefa sceal \u00e6g\u00f0\u00e6r witan ge hlafordes landriht ge folces gerihtu, be \u00f0am \u00f0e hit of ealddagum\nFor\u00f0am on manegum landum til\u00f0 bi\u00f0 redre \u00f0onne on o\u00f0rum: ge yr\u00f0e tima hr\u00e6dra, ge m\u00e6da r\u00e6dran, ge\nHede se \u00f0e scire healde, \u00fe\u00e6t he fri\u00f0ige & for\u00f0ige \u00e6lce be \u00f0am \u00f0e hit selest sy; & be \u00f0am he eac mot, \u00f0e\nHe sceal snotorlice smeagean & georne \u00f0urhsmugan ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ing, \u00f0e hlaforde magan to r\u00e6de.\nGyf he wel aginnan wile, ne m\u00e6ig he sleac beon ne to oferhydig; ac he mot \u00e6g\u00f0er witan ge l\u00e6sse ge\nFor\u00f0am to so\u00f0e ic secge: oferhogie he o\u00f0\u00f0e forgyme \u00f0a \u00f0ing to beganne & to bewitanne, \u00f0e to scipene\nAc ic l\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he do, swa ic \u00e6r cw\u00e6\u00f0: gyme \u00e6g\u00f0er ge \u00f0\u00e6s selran ge \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6mran, \u00fe\u00e6t na\u00f0or ne misfare,\nSwa sceal god scyrman his hlafordes healdan, do ymbe his agen, swa swa he wylle.\nA swa he gecneordra swa bi\u00f0 he weor\u00f0ra, gyf he wi\u00f0 witan hafo\u00f0 his wisan gem\u00e6ne.\nSymle he sceal his hyrmen scyrpan mid manunge to hlafordes neode & him eac leanian be \u00f0am \u00f0e hy\nNe l\u00e6te he n\u00e6fre his hyrmen hyne oferwealdan, ac wille he \u00e6lcne mid hlafordes creafte & mid folcrihte:\n\u00c6fre he m\u00e6ig findan, on \u00f0am he m\u00e6ig nyt beon & \u00f0a nytte don, \u00f0e him fylstan scylan; huru is m\u00e6st\nMe m\u00e6ig in Maio & Iunio & Iulio on sumera fealgian, myxendincgan ut dragan, lochyrdla tilian, sceap\nOn h\u00e6rfeste ripan, in Agusto & Septembri & Octobri mawan, wad spittan, fela til\u00f0a ham g\u00e6derian,\nOn wintra erian & in miclum gefyrstum timber cleofan, orceard r\u00e6ran & m\u00e6nige inweorc wyrcean,\nOn l\u00e6ngtene eregian & impian, beana sawan, wingeard settan, dician, deorhege heawan & ra\u00f0e \u00e6fter\nA he m\u00e6ig findan, hw\u00e6t he m\u00e6ig on byrig betan ne \u00f0earf he na unnyt beon, \u00f0onne he \u00f0\u00e6r binnan bi\u00f0:\nHe sceal fela tola to tune tilian & fela andlomena to husan habban.\n\u00c6cse, adsan, bil, byrse, scafan, sage, cimbiren, tigehoc, n\u00e6febor, mattuc, ippingiren, scear, culter & eac\n& fela towtola: flexlinan, spinle, reol, gearnwindan, stodlan, lorgas, presse, pihten, timplean, wifte,\nAnd gif he smeawyrhtan h\u00e6f\u00f0, \u00f0am he sceal to tolan fylstan: mylewerde, sutere, leodgotan & o\u00f0ran\nMan sceal habban w\u00e6ngew\u00e6du, sulhgesidu, ege\u00f0getigu & fela \u00f0inga, \u00f0e ic nu gen\u00e6mnian ne can, ge\nHit is earfo\u00f0e eall to gesecganne, \u00fe\u00e6t se be\u00f0encan sceal, \u00f0e scire healt.\nNe sceolde he nan \u00f0ing forgyman, \u00f0e \u00e6fre to note mehte: ne for\u00f0a musfellan ne, \u00fe\u00e6t git l\u00e6sse is, to\nFela sceal to holdan hames gerefan & to gemetf\u00e6stan manna hyrde.\nIc gecende be \u00f0am \u00f0e ic cu\u00f0e; se \u00f0e bet cunne, gecy\u00f0e his mare.",
